,[389,577],[440,755],[824,399],[247,730],[236,748],[251,761],[228,860],[266,774],[761,795],[180,750],[207,750],[427,771],[243,813],[217,816],[451,772],[509,638],[263,743],[231,831],[364,468],[426,738],[463,788],[453,739],[439,787],[192,734],[426,802],[266,812],[413,784],[449,804],[402,735],[403,769],[515,246],[241,847],[216,400],[403,583],[753,72],[190,522],[440,837],[412,815],[403,799],[424,846],[180,720],[474,736],[421,830],[405,523],[205,723],[463,586],[263,703],[396,784],[220,845],[403,839],[125,443],[236,598],[172,732],[627,79],[167,649],[378,879],[377,485],[407,854],[213,870],[211,832],[664,53],[401,824],[261,718],[272,756],[524,180],[144,228],[393,859],[405,868],[365,448],[390,873],[677,316],[227,875],[568,361],[641,162],[213,884],[258,977],[724,39],[764,152],[573,502],[556,536],[420,860],[794,468],[200,889],[389,675],[131,335],[446,917],[271,640],[196,401],[465,803],[211,856],[634,612],[259,406],[345,462],[268,728],[197,482],[945,922],[608,132],[283,503],[202,877],[1006,915],[257,845],[740,161],[90,255],[201,815],[771,92],[255,474],[881,367],[415,512],[162,560],[810,795],[657,417],[200,521],[824,947],[262,511],[163,89],[992,319],[111,67],[166,837],[613,1010],[0,634],[0,731],[646,655],[899,895],[330,74],[294,89],[37,996]]}},"text":{"4":"Before he left, Bodie had lent her his big box of crayons. \u201cSo you won\u2019t be bored,\u201d he had said. Jodie drew fast, the way she did everything. Swish-swash! A big, wavy sea. Swish-swash! A smiling dolphin. Mom peeked over her shoulder. \u201cWow,\u201d she said. \u201cThe sea!\u201d","14":"It was a dolphin, and he was laughing. Click-click-click! \u201cYou\u2019re FAST!\u201d he said. \u201cI\u2019m Dash, the fastest dolphin in Sparkle Bay.\u201d Jodie grinned. \u201cAnd I\u2019m Jodie, the fastest girl on Maple Street!\u201d They looked at each other. \u201cRace you!\u201d they both shouted at once.","22":"Jodie looked. She saw seaweed. Just seaweed. Then the seaweed blinked! It was a tiny seahorse, curled up like a question mark. \u201cThat\u2019s Squiggle,\u201d whispered Nori. Squiggle wrapped his curly tail around Jodie\u2019s finger. \u201cHello,\u201d he squeaked. \u201cYou swim very fast!\u201d","26":"Down on the sand, three little crabs were dancing. Snip-snap! Step to the side. Snip-snap! Step to the other side. Jodie tried the crab dance too. She went sideways, and sideways, and BUMP, right into Dash. Everybody laughed, even the crabs.","32":"Far away, past the coral, swam Big Bloo, the gentle whale. Whoosh! Up went her spout, like a fountain. \u201cBig Bloo sings the slowest songs in the sea,\u201d said Nori. \u201cOoooooo,\u201d sang Big Bloo. \u201cOne song takes her a whole day!\u201d said Dash. Jodie giggled."}}